<!--
  Runtime-embedded assets for sound-mind-studio-lib (see theme.h/.cpp and
  landing_page.cpp) - compiled in via Qt's resource system (CMAKE_AUTORCC),
  so nothing here depends on a loose file being deployed alongside the exe.

  ChooseAgainIcon.ico is deliberately NOT embedded here - it's used only via
  resources/app.rc, as the executable's native Win32 icon resource, which
  the RC compiler reads directly at build time. Loading it through Qt at
  runtime instead would pull in the qico imageformat plugin as a real
  runtime dependency for no benefit, since QApplication::setWindowIcon()
  and MainWindow's own icon both use the PNG below just as well.
-->
<RCC>
    <qresource prefix="/">
        <file>ChooseAgainLarge.png</file>
    </qresource>
</RCC>
